  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26054001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "有咲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "在的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可以解释下这个是什么情况吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "|101|取出背后画有「神宫有咲最喜欢的主人」涂鸦的文化衫。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "哎呀呀，是很好看的涂鸦呢，不知道是谁这么可爱给主人画上的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你的名字都在上面了啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "那也可能是别人的陷害。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以这是陷害吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "不是哦！嘿嘿，没想到被主人发现了呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊，被朋友用奇怪的表情盯了一整天，他们可能觉得我在这个世界已经没有在意的人了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "后果这么严重的吗？主人是讨厌上面的涂鸦，还是讨厌有咲在上面写的东西？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……两个都不讨厌。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "诶诶？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "算了，当我什么都没说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26054015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "神宫有咲",
          "text": "嘿嘿。果然，今天的主人也很值得有咲喜欢啊~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
